{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"En-算畴"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"En-算畴"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$E_n$-算畴的一种构造是"},{"Local":{"url":"小n-方块算畴","text":"小 $n$-方块算畴"}},{"Plain":", 其 $k$ 元运算是 $k$ 个方块 $\\sqcup_k [0,1]^n$ 到一个方块的 “横平竖直” 的嵌入.</p>\n<p>与 $\\mathbb E_n$ 密切相关的一个算畴是 $\\mathsf{BTop}(n)$, 见"},{"Local":{"url":"BTop_n","text":"拓扑圆盘的分类空间"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}